    "about.title": "About ZRP Social",
    "about.subtitle": "Swiss European Social Media Platform",
    "about.p1": "was born from a simple but powerful idea:",
    "about.p1Bold": "freedom of speech belongs to everyone.",
    "about.p2": "In a world where voices are increasingly silenced, we decided to build a platform that puts people first. No censorship. No manipulation. No hidden agendas.",
    "about.p3": "We are proud to be a Swiss European social media platform, built on the principles of neutrality, privacy, and security. Switzerland's strong legal framework and its commitment to free expression make it the perfect home for ZRP Social.",
    "about.p3Bold": "Swiss European social media platform",
    "about.p4": "Our mission is simple:",
    "about.p4Bold": "to give a voice to the voiceless.",
    "about.p5": "ZRP Social will always stand as a people's voice against anyone who tries to hold back freedom of speech. We believe that open, honest, and respectful conversation is the foundation of a free society.",
    "about.p5Em": "We are not just another social network: we are a movement. A movement that says",
    "about.p6": "With ZRP Social, you can speak freely, connect authentically, and build communities without fear. Your data is yours. Your voice is yours. Your freedom is non-negotiable.",
    "about.tagline": "ZRP will stay all life: a people's voice for the people.",
    "about.value1Title": "Freedom of Speech",
    "about.value1Desc": "We protect your right to express yourself without fear.",
    "about.value2Title": "Privacy & Security",
    "about.value2Desc": "Built in Switzerland, with Swiss laws and strong data protection.",
    "about.value3Title": "People First",
    "about.value3Desc": "35% of profits go to charity: we believe in making a difference.",
    "about.ctaText": "Join the movement. Be heard.",
    "about.ctaButton": "Create your account",
    "about.storySectionTitle": "Our Story",
    "about.valuesSectionTitle": "Our Values",
