    "help.opportunity.applyIntro": "Open a listing and select Apply. Some listings collect applications on ZRP directly; others link out to an external application page instead.",
    "help.opportunity.applyingHeading": "Applying",
    "help.opportunity.f3Desc": "If your listing accepts in-platform applications, view every applicant's cover note and attached resume from your listing's Applicants page.",
    "help.opportunity.f3Title": "Reviewing Applicants",
