    "help.music.browseLink": "Open ZRP Music",
    "help.music.reportText": "ZRP Music doesn't yet have a dedicated in-app button for reporting a specific track. If you believe a track infringes your rights or violates ZRP's policies, contact ZRP Support with the track and artist details.",
    "help.music.prohibitedText": "Music and artwork must follow ZRP's Community Guidelines: no unauthorized copyrighted material, stolen or leaked recordings, or content that is illegal, hateful, harassing or otherwise violates ZRP's rules.",
    "help.music.prohibitedTitle": "Prohibited Content",
    "help.music.artworkText": "Cover art must also be authorized for use - don't upload artwork that violates someone else's copyright, trademark, privacy or other rights.",
    "help.music.artworkTitle": "Artwork Rights",
    "help.music.responsibilitiesText": "You're responsible for the audio, artwork and metadata you upload, including accurate artist and album information, and for not misrepresenting who created a track.",
    "help.music.responsibilitiesTitle": "Your Responsibilities",
    "help.music.rightsText": "You must own the recording, or have the rights, license or permission needed to upload and distribute it. ZRP does not transfer or grant you copyright in any content.",
    "help.music.rightsTitle": "Rights & Ownership",
    "help.music.uploaderPolicyIntro": "Being authorized to publish on ZRP Music does not give you rights to music owned by someone else. By publishing on ZRP Music, you're responsible for making sure you have the necessary rights, permissions or authorization for everything you upload.",
    "help.music.uploaderPolicyHeading": "ZRP Music Uploader Policy",
    "help.music.albumNote": "Deleting an album never deletes its tracks - they simply become standalone tracks again. Album duration and track count are calculated from your published tracks' real data.",
    "help.music.studioC6": "Remove a track from an album, or delete the album itself",
    "help.music.studioC5": "Add tracks to an album and reorder them",
    "help.music.studioC4": "Create and manage albums",
    "help.music.studioC3": "Edit or delete a track you've already published",
    "help.music.studioC2": "Add a title, genre, description and explicit-content flag",
    "help.music.studioC1": "Upload a track with its audio file and cover artwork",
    "help.music.studioIntro": "Music Studio is where an approved Creator or verified Artist manages their music. Once you have publishing access, open Music Studio from ZRP Music to:",
    "help.music.studioHeading": "Music Studio",
    "help.music.artistText": "Anyone can create an Artist Profile in Music Studio. Publishing unlocks once that profile is verified by ZRP staff.",
    "help.music.artistTitle": "Verified Music Artist",
    "help.music.creatorText": "Creator status unlocks Music publishing automatically for accounts on ZRP's Business or Enterprise plan.",
    "help.music.creatorTitle": "Creator Status",
    "help.music.publishingIntro": "Listening to ZRP Music is open to everyone. Publishing music requires an approved Creator status or a verified Music Artist profile - a standard ZRP account on its own is not enough to publish.",
    "help.music.publishingHeading": "Who Can Publish",
    "help.music.f4Desc": "Signed-in listeners can see their recently played tracks and liked music in one place.",
    "help.music.f4Title": "Recently Played",
    "help.music.f3Desc": "Sign in to like tracks, build playlists, and add or remove tracks from them at any time.",
    "help.music.f3Title": "Playlists & Likes",
    "help.music.f2Desc": "Play, pause, skip, seek, adjust volume, shuffle and repeat. Add tracks to your queue and keep listening while you use the rest of ZRP.",
    "help.music.f2Title": "Player & Queue",
    "help.music.f1Desc": "Find songs, artists and albums by name, or browse Discover and genre pages to find something new.",
    "help.music.f1Title": "Search & Discover",
    "help.music.listeningIntro": "Listening to ZRP Music is open to everyone. Search for songs, artists and albums, browse Discover and genre pages, and play anything you find - no special status required.",
    "help.music.listeningHeading": "Listening",
    "help.music.intro": "ZRP Music is the music experience built into ZRP Social, where you can discover tracks, artists and albums, and - if you qualify - publish your own music. Open ZRP Music from the main navigation to start listening.",
    "help.section.music.subtitle": "Listening, publishing, Music Studio, and the Uploader Policy",
    "help.section.music.title": "ZRP Music",
