    "help.creatorEconomy.intro": "ZRP gives creators tools to publish, build an audience, understand engagement, and participate in platform monetisation features where available.",
    "help.creatorEconomy.f1Title": "Creator Analytics",
    "help.creatorEconomy.f1Desc": "Understand audience engagement, reach, and content performance with the analytics available on your plan.",
    "help.creatorEconomy.f2Title": "Verified Identity",
    "help.creatorEconomy.f2Desc": "Eligible paid and professional accounts may have access to verification features according to ZRP's current policies.",
    "help.creatorEconomy.f3Title": "Creator Monetisation",
    "help.creatorEconomy.f3Desc": "Where enabled, creators can participate in monetisation features such as tips and premium content.",
    "help.creatorEconomy.f4Title": "Digital Payments",
    "help.creatorEconomy.f4Desc": "Certain creator features may support digital payments or blockchain-based payment infrastructure where enabled by ZRP.",
    "help.creatorEconomy.web3Title": "Web3-ready by design",
    "help.creatorEconomy.web3Desc": "ZRP can integrate modern digital ownership and payment technologies without making them a requirement for ordinary users. The goal is simple: powerful technology underneath, familiar social experiences on top.",
