    "help.reporting.note": "Reporting does not automatically mean content will be removed. Reports are reviewed according to applicable law, ZRP's Terms, and Community Guidelines.",
    "help.deletion.intro": "You can request deletion of your ZRP account and associated personal data through the available account controls.",
