    "faq.cat.marketPlus": "ZRP Market Plus",
    "faq.whatIsMarketPlus.q": "What is ZRP Market Plus?",
    "faq.whatIsMarketPlus.p1Bold": "ZRP Market Plus",
    "faq.whatIsMarketPlus.p1": "is a marketplace inside ZRP Social for buying and selling high-value items: luxury and exotic cars, yachts and boats, private aircraft and helicopters, luxury real estate and hotels, and fine watches and jewelry.",
    "faq.whatIsMarketPlus.p2": "Every listing goes through a moderation review before it becomes visible, and buyers contact sellers directly through ZRP's existing messaging system: no separate marketplace account or app needed.",
    "faq.whatIsMarketPlus.note": "ZRP does not process payments or hold funds for marketplace transactions. Buyers and sellers arrange payment and delivery directly, and should always exercise the same caution as any high-value private sale.",
    "faq.howToListMarket.q": "How do I list an item for sale?",
    "faq.howToListMarket.intro": "Anyone with a ZRP account can create a listing:",
    "faq.howToListMarket.step1": "Open Market Plus from the sidebar and tap \"Sell an item.\"",
    "faq.howToListMarket.step2": "Choose a category and add photos or a short video.",
    "faq.howToListMarket.step3": "Write a title, description, price (or \"Price on request\"), and location.",
    "faq.howToListMarket.step4": "Submit for review.",
    "faq.howToListMarket.step5": "Your listing goes live once our moderation team approves it: you'll get a notification either way.",
    "faq.howToListMarket.note": "You can edit or remove your listings any time from \"My Listings\" in your seller dashboard.",
    "faq.marketLimits.q": "How many items can I list, and are there fees?",
    "faq.marketLimits.intro": "Listing on Market Plus is free: how many active listings you can have at once depends on your ZRP plan:",
    "faq.marketLimits.freeLabel": "Free",
    "faq.marketLimits.freeDesc": "1 active listing, up to 4 photos",
    "faq.marketLimits.proLabel": "Pro",
    "faq.marketLimits.proDesc": "5 active listings, up to 8 photos",
    "faq.marketLimits.businessLabel": "Business",
    "faq.marketLimits.businessDesc": "25 active listings, up to 15 photos",
    "faq.marketLimits.enterpriseLabel": "Enterprise",
    "faq.marketLimits.enterpriseDesc": "Unlimited listings and photos",
    "faq.marketLimits.note": "ZRP does not charge a commission on sales made through Market Plus.",
    "faq.marketModeration.q": "How are listings moderated?",
    "faq.marketModeration.p1": "Every listing is reviewed by our moderation team before it becomes visible to buyers: nothing goes live automatically. We check that the item fits an approved category and that the listing doesn't look fraudulent, misleading, or prohibited.",
    "faq.marketModeration.p2": "If a listing is rejected, the seller sees the reason and can resubmit. A listing that's already live can also be removed later if it's reported and found to violate marketplace guidelines: the seller is notified either way.",
    "faq.marketModeration.note": "You can report a suspicious listing directly from its page, the same way you'd report a post.",
    "faq.contactSeller.q": "How do I contact a seller?",
    "faq.contactSeller.p1": "Tap \"Contact seller\" on any listing to open a direct message with the seller using ZRP's existing messaging system, the same chat you use everywhere else on ZRP.",
    "faq.contactSeller.p2": "There's no separate marketplace inbox or in-app payment flow. Treat a marketplace deal like any other high-value private sale: verify the item, meet safely, and never send money before you've confirmed what you're buying.",
    "help.section.marketplace.title": "ZRP Market Plus",
    "help.section.marketplace.subtitle": "Buy and sell luxury items with confidence",
    "help.marketplace.intro": "Market Plus is ZRP's marketplace for luxury and high-value items: cars, yachts, aircraft, real estate, watches, and jewelry, built on the same trust, moderation, and messaging systems as the rest of ZRP.",
    "help.marketplace.f1Title": "Curated Categories",
    "help.marketplace.f1Desc": "Browse luxury and exotic cars, yachts and boats, private aircraft and helicopters, luxury real estate and hotels, and fine watches and jewelry.",
    "help.marketplace.f2Title": "List in Minutes",
    "help.marketplace.f2Desc": "Any ZRP account can create a listing with photos or video, a price (or \"Price on request\"), and a location.",
    "help.marketplace.f3Title": "Moderated Before It Goes Live",
    "help.marketplace.f3Desc": "Every listing is reviewed by our moderation team before buyers can see it, and can be reported or removed later if it breaks marketplace guidelines.",
    "help.marketplace.f4Title": "Message Sellers Directly",
    "help.marketplace.f4Desc": "Contact a seller through ZRP's existing messaging system: no separate marketplace account, inbox, or payment flow.",
    "help.marketplace.note": "ZRP does not process payments or hold funds for marketplace transactions. Buyers and sellers arrange payment and delivery directly.",
    "help.marketplace.browseLink": "Browse Market Plus",
