    "faq.privacyPolicyFaq.q": "我的数据如何受到保护？",
    "faq.privacyPolicyFaq.intro": "ZRP Social 高度重视隐私和安全。",
    "faq.privacyPolicyFaq.item1": "使用 HTTPS/TLS 的加密连接。",
    "faq.privacyPolicyFaq.item2": "旨在保护账户信息的安全控制措施。",
    "faq.privacyPolicyFaq.item3": "针对平台系统的访问控制。",
    "faq.privacyPolicyFaq.item4": "用于识别和应对滥用行为的流程。",
    "faq.privacyPolicyFaq.item5": "账户删除与隐私权利。",
    "faq.privacyPolicyFaq.readMore": "要了解完整信息，请阅读我们的",
    "faq.privacyPolicyFaq.readMoreLink": "隐私政策",
    "faq.howToReport.q": "如何举报不当内容？",
    "faq.howToReport.step1": "打开相关的帖子、评论或内容。",
    "faq.howToReport.step2": "选择更多或举报菜单。",
